<augBlueprint name="OE_ACID_O2SYS">
	<title>Acidic Filtering System</title>
	<desc>Oxygen System can be switched between providing oxygen and putting out fires.

Can be toggled in the storage menu outside of combat.
In oxygen mode the system will provide 0.6 hp/sec which will scale up to 1.2 hp/sec at 4 power.
In extinguisher mode the system will provide 1.8 hp/sec which will scale up to 3.6 hp/sec at 4 power.</desc>
